    "final_output": "To submit an access request for the staging namespace on behalf of a new team member, the team must follow the Production Access Request Procedure outlined in PROC-004, version 2.2. Here are the steps:\n\n1. The process begins with the team member, who will be the requester, contacting the team lead or a designated liaison to initiate the request.\n2. The requester's information, including their role and the specific production resource (in this case, the staging namespace) being requested, must be provided.\n3. The Identity and Access Team Lead will review the production access request individually. There is no auto-approval path for any requester, including new team members.\n\nSources: PROC-004",
