    "final_output": "I'm unable to resubmit your production access request for you. However, I can provide guidance on how to improve your request based on the provided context.\n\nAccording to the Production Access Request Procedure (PROC-004, version 2.2), each request is reviewed individually by the Identity and Access Team Lead against the requester's role and the specific production resource being requested. There is no auto-approval path for any requester, including pilot users.\n\nTo increase the chances of approval, ensure your request is clear, concise, and specifically states the production resource you need access to. Also, provide a detailed justification for your request, explaining the reasons why your role requires access to that particular resource.\n\nSources: PROC-004",
